#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:2
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Registro"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:4
msgid ""
"QiliSDK reports what it is doing through `Loguru "
"<https://loguru.readthedocs.io>`_. Logging is configured automatically "
"when the package is imported, and can be adjusted at any time via "
":func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging`."
msgstr ""
"QiliSDK informa de lo que está haciendo mediante `Loguru "
"<https://loguru.readthedocs.io>`_. El registro se configura automáticamente "
"al importar el paquete y puede ajustarse en cualquier momento mediante "
":func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging`."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:8
msgid ""
"By default only messages of level ``WARNING`` and above are shown, and "
"they are written to the console (``stderr``)."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto solo se muestran los mensajes de nivel ``WARNING`` o superior, y "
"se escriben en la consola (``stderr``)."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:11
msgid "Changing the verbosity"
msgstr "Cambiar el nivel de detalle"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:13
msgid ""
"Call :func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging` with a ``level`` to "
"override the verbosity:"
msgstr ""
"Llama a :func:`~qilisdk.logging.configure_logging` con un ``level`` para "
"sobrescribir el nivel de detalle:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:21
msgid ""
"All other options of the configured sinks (format, filter, colours, ...) "
"are preserved, so only the threshold changes. Calling it again replaces "
"the previous configuration, so the last call wins."
msgstr ""
"El resto de opciones de los sinks configurados (formato, filtro, colores, "
"...) se conservan, por lo que solo cambia el umbral. Volver a llamarla "
"reemplaza la configuración anterior, así que prevalece la última llamada."

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:25
msgid "Logging to a file"
msgstr "Registro en un archivo"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:27
msgid "Pass a ``filename`` to copy the console output into a text file:"
msgstr ""
"Pasa un ``filename`` para copiar la salida de la consola en un archivo de "
"texto:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:41
msgid "Logging levels"
msgstr "Niveles de registro"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:43
msgid "QiliSDK uses the standard Loguru levels, each with its own icon:"
msgstr ""
"QiliSDK utiliza los niveles estándar de Loguru, cada uno con su propio icono:"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:49
msgid "Level"
msgstr "Nivel"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:50
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Icono"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:51
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Significado"

#: ../../modules/logging/logging.rst:52
